{"ticker":{"symbol":"114190.KQ","name":"강원에너지","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":7720.0,"change_pct":-0.01404853128991057,"market_cap":201669853184.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":6040.0,"week52_high":19360.0,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"South Korea","city":"Gunsan-si","employees":101,"website":"https://www.kwenergy.co.kr/","business_summary":"KANGWON ENERGY Co., Ltd. engages in the secondary battery and energy plant business. It offers services in the plant and secondary battery sectors, including heat, basic, and detailed design, as well as procurement, production, fabrication, installation, and commissioning. The company provides system engineering, PD mixers, storage vessels, and powder weighing and transfer systems; and cathode material manufacturing equipment, such as electric heater dryers, electro magnetic filters, jet mills, roll crushers, and sievers. It also designs, manufactures, installs, and commissions water tube steam generators, sulfur recovery unit, hot oil heaters, waste heat boilers, and heat recovery steam generators. The company was formerly known as KANGWON Co., Ltd. and changed its name to KANGWON ENERGY Co.,Ltd. in October 2021. KANGWON ENERGY Co., Ltd. was founded in 1976 and is headquartered in Gunsan-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"강원에너지(주)는 2차전지 및 에너지플랜트 사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 열, 기본, 상세설계는 물론 조달, 생산, 제작, 설치, 시운전 등 플랜트 및 2차전지 부문에 대한 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 시스템 엔지니어링, PD 혼합기, 저장 용기, 분말 계량 및 이송 시스템을 제공합니다. 전기히터건조기, 전자기필터, 제트밀, 롤크러셔, 체 등의 양극재 제조장비 등이 있다. 또한 수관 증기 발생기, 유황 회수 장치, 고온 오일 히터, 폐열 보일러 및 배열 회수 증기 발생기를 설계, 제조, 설치 및 시운전합니다. 주식회사 강원은 사명을 강원에너지주식회사로 변경하였습니다. 2021년 10월. 강원에너지주식회사는 1976년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 군산시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"산업기계","financials":[{"period":"2022